{
  "id": "MRK.13",
  "number": "13",
  "bookId": "MRK",
  "reference": "Mariko 13",
  "verseCount": 37,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "13",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MRK 13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu yaboola akokhukwisibwa kweihekalu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nolwa yali narulanga muhekalu, oundi khubeechibe namusunjila mbu Omwechesia, lolakhwo amachina kano shinga olwa kali, kata nende tsinyumbashe tsino! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu namukalusia mbu Oluutsi tsinyumbashe tsino tsingali? Shililitong'aho lichina elala hekulu khulindi, eliralisukunwa hasi ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eminyakhano nende obusandibwi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nolwa yali niyeekhaale khushikulu shiEmitseituni ahahengana nende ihekalu, Petero naYakobo naYohana naAnderea nibamureeba masilisi, bari ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuboolelekhwo, mbu amakhuwa ako kaliikhola liina? Kata neshilolelo shiina eshilibaho ako kosi olwa kaliba nikali okhuusibwa?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Yesu nachaaka okhubaboolela ari Mwirecheshe, omundu yesi aleshe okhumushiamia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanji bakheetsenje muliira lianje, nibaboola bari Isie nisie; nibabashiamia bario abanji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa mulahulilanga khukobusoolo nende amakhuwa kamahe, muleshe okhuhenda; ako kakhoyile okhwikhola; ne obumaliilishi nibushili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba lihanga lilabuushila khwihanga lindi, khandi oburuchi khuburuchi bundi; khulabaho okhurenga khweshialo eyi nende eyi; inzala nayo yilabeetsangaho; ako kosi nokhuchaaka butswa khweinumwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne mwirecheshe; shichila balamukhobana nibamuyila mubiina; mutsisinagogi mulanywekhwa; ne mulasinjila imbeli wabaami nende abaruchi khulwanje, mube oburumbusi khubo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne khatimba injiili yiranjilile okhwilwatsilwa amahanga kosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nolwa bamuyila nibamwinjilila itookho, murahenda mbeli mbu namuboole shiina, tawe; ne kosi aka mulaheebwa khushise shieneshio, niko aka mulaboola; shichila shimuli inywe ababoola ta, habula Roho Omutakatifu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omundu alakhoba omwana wabwe okhwirwa, nende samwana ario omwanawe; abaana nabo balabuushila khubeebuli babwe, nibachila nibeerwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne mulakiywa nabandu bosi khulwa eliira lianje; nebutswa owifwila okhuula khushihesi, omwenoyo alahonibwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Akamasila amakali",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa mulola Eshisinyo Shiobwonooneshi nasinjiile aha arakhoyile ta (ousooma ayililisie bulayi), mana abali mubuYahudi beelushile mubikulu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "noyo ouba nali hekulu khushilama shieinzuye aleshe okhwikha kata okhwinjilamwo mbu ayinie eshindu shiosi eshili munzuye; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kata ouba nali mumukunda arakalukha ingo okhubukula inguboye ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Woowe khubaliba nibabeleeshe nende abaliba nibanuuninjia mundaalo etsio! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musaayenje mbu kaleshe okhwikhola murootso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shichila tsindaalo etsio tsiliba tsiamatinyu, nakafwana kario kashili okhubaho kata okhurula khukhuchaaka khwobulonji obwa Nyasaye yalonga okhuula bulaano, kata shikalibakhwoho ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwami alabula okhukhalaka tsindaalo, khane shiyakhahonile omundu kata mulala ta; nebutswa khulwa abalobole, aba yalobola, yakhalaache tsindaalo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mundaalo etsio omundu naba namusunjila ari Lole, Kristo ngwowuno; kata mbu Lole, ngwoyo; murafuchiilila ta; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shichila balibuukha abaKristo bobubeeyi nabanabii bobubeeyi, nibalolosia ebilolelo nende akamakana, mbu bakosie kata abalobole nikaba nikanyalikha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne inywe mwirecheshe; lole, emubooleele amakhuwa kosi khale.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okhwitsa khwOmwana womundu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne mundaalo tsienetsio, inyuma wamasila ako, omubasu kulikwa eshiilima, kata omwesi shikuliakhakhwo ta, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tsinyininyini natsio tsiliakukhanga okhurula mwikulu, ebietsingufu ebiliho mwikulu nibitechesibwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana balilola Omwana wOmundu niyeetsa mumaleesi nende obunyali obunji noluyali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwenaho aliruma abamalaikabe, nakhung'aasia abalobolebe okhurula ahamiyeka chiosi chine, okhurula khushihesi shieshialo okhuula khushihesi shielikulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eliechesio liomukhuyu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho bulaano mweche oluchelo khumukhuyu; mbu olwa lisaka liakwo libeetsanga liakhakalukha libisi nilisebukha, habwenaho mumanyanga mbu tsindaalo tsiomubasu omunji tsili ahambi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neenyu mwesi olwa mulalola amakhuwa kano nikeekhola, mumanye murio mbu ali ahambi, kata hamuliango bwene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emuboolela toto, mbu Olwibulo luno shilulihwaho ta okhuula olwa kano kosi kaliba nikamalile okhuusibwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Likulu nende eshibala bilihwaho; ne amasungo kanje shikalihwaho ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abulaho oumanyilekhwo inyanga kata isaa ta",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne inyanga yene kata isaa yene, abulaho oumanyilekhwo, kata abamalaika abomwikulu ta, kata Omwana, habula Samwana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwirecheshe, nimuba meeso, [musaayenje]; shichila shimumanyile induukho olwa yiliula ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kali shingana omundu ouli khuluchendo mushialo shindi, niyaleshile inzuye naheelesiye abasumbabe obunyali, buli mundu khumulimokwe, nalachile omulindi weshilibwa yesi okhubeetsanga meeso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khulwako mubeetsenje meeso; okhuba shi-mumanyilekhwo eshise eshia omwami omwenengo yeetsa okhwitsilamwo ta, kata mungoloobe, kata mushilo hakari, kata muyakashio, kata mumabwibwi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "muleshe okhwitsukhana niyoolile, namunyoola nimukonile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne elia emuboolela inywe embaboolela bosi, mbu Mube meeso.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
